    "replication": "E1's conclusions replicate if, on at least 2 of the 3 new phonebooks: (i) balanced replay recalls 10/10 of both books after 100 updates; (ii) plain fine-tuning ends 300 updates with B=10/10 and at most 2 of A recalled; and (iii) the L2-SP decision rule applied to the 3 new phonebooks over the same grid gives the same verdict as E1 at both 100 and 300 updates.",
